<title>USA: Oak Industries names Hicks CFO.</title>
<headline>Oak Industries names Hicks CFO.</headline>
<dateline>WALTHAM, Mass. 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oak Industries Inc said Monday it had named Coleman Hicks chief financial officer to replace Francis Lunger.</p>
<p>The company said Lunger was leaving to join Millipore Corp as chief financial officer and vice president.</p>
<p>Hicks is a senior vice president who had served since 1995 as president of the Oak Frequency Control Group and as general counsel, the company said.</p>
<p>Mela Lew, vice president and assistant general counsel, will take over as general counsel and secretary, the company said.</p>
</text>
